     5. task 2 (`ef55b0f`);
     6. task 3 (`599aead`);
     7. report (`e774bef`);
     8. advisor fixes (`956217e`);
     9. memory.
   - **Last line, what was not checked:**
     - no witness has a backward `hb` edge;
     - `HB` (closure ∪ init rule) is not proved transitive;
     - no link to the authority traces (couche R).

